new_head "Re: re: Samurai"
new_text "Seppuko:Well if you are doing Seppuko as you have described in the note above, thenthe cost of it, should not be spell points, but Experience Points.I would suggest that for EACH use, they lose 10% of ALL their experience points.That way they are not losing all that they would with a death, but they dolose something.    Dancer in the Dreams of Fate."
